  "instructions": [
    "season the lamb with salt and black pepper.",
    "heat the olive oil in a wok over medium-high heat.",
    "add the lamb to the wok and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "add the onion, garlic, and ginger to the wok and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "add the mixed spice blend to the wok and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add the chicken broth, honey, apricots, and almonds to the wok.",
    "bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 1 hour.",
    "stir in the parsley and cook for an additional 10 minutes.",
    "serve the lamb hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
